stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> PENDING : pharmacy owner registers
    PENDING --> APPROVED : admin approves
    PENDING --> REVOKED : admin revokes (rejects)
    APPROVED --> REVOKED : admin revokes (pending requests cancelled)
    REVOKED --> APPROVED : admin approves again
    APPROVED --> PENDING : owner edits name, address or location

    note right of APPROVED
        Only APPROVED pharmacies are public
        (search, directory, requests).
        Every change is stored in PharmacyApprovalLog.
    end note
